# ==============================================================================
# CivicSight Frontend Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# For plain HTML/JS setups, configuration is read from `frontend/js/config.local.js`
# (or optionally via this frontend/.env file).
#
# GOOGLE CLOUD CONSOLE SETUP:
# 1. Credentials: Go to Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials.
# 2. Enable APIs: Enable 'Maps JavaScript API' (and optionally 'Geocoding API').
# 3. Create Map ID: Under Maps Management, create a Map ID (required for AdvancedMarkerElement).
# 4. Security Restrictions: Restrict API Key by HTTP referrer (e.g. http://localhost:*/*, http://127.0.0.1:*/*)
#    and restrict API usage to Maps JavaScript API and Geocoding API.
#
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY="YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY"
GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID="YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID"
